  "text": "BluePearl Pet Hospital | Scottsdale, AZ\nSkip to the content\nJoin the BluePearl Family!\nWe're hiring.\nFind a Hospital\nSearch the site\nSearch\nSearch the site\nSearch\nResources for Pet Owners\nWhy BluePearl\nIntake Form\nPay with CareCredit\nPet Care Articles and Videos\nStories from the Heart\nResources for Veterinarians\nWhy Refer to BluePearl\nReferral Portal & Medical Records\nOrder BluePearl Materials\nMedical Library for DVMs\nAbout Us\nWho We Are\nOur Areas of Expertise\nNewsroom\nContact Us\nCareers\nFind a Hospital\nHome\nHospitals\nBluePearl Pet Hospital Scottsdale, AZ\nBluePearl Pet Hospital\nScottsdale, AZ\n24/7 Emergency and Specialty\n480.949.8001\n22595 N Scottsdale Rd. Ste. 110\nScottsdale, AZ 85255\n[email protected]\ninstagram.com/bluepearl_scottsdale\nEmergency:\n24/7\nSpecialty:\nBy appointment\nRequest Appointment\nOverview\nServices\nOur vets\nReferring vets\nRequest Appointment\nOverview\nServices\nOur vets\nReferring vets\nRequest Appointment\nBluePearl Pet Hospital – serving Scottsdale and surrounding communities.\nWe are open around the clock providing advanced veterinary care to pets in Scottsdale, Cave Creek, Fountain Hills, Carefree, Rio Verde, Paradise Valley and more.\nOur reviews.\nOur services.\nWhen your pet needs emergency care, seconds count. Our team is ready to provide expert care 24/7 in case of a pet emergency. If your pet requires a veterinary specialist, we are ready for that too. Our experienced team of veterinarians, vet technicians and support staff work closely together to provide the comprehensive, compassionate care your pet needs and deserves.\nEmergency\nIf possible, call ahead and let our 24 hour emergency vet know you’re coming. No appointment is necessary.\nLearn more about your Emergency visit\n.\nSpecialty care\nOur\ninternal medicine\nspecialist works directly with your primary care vet to understand your pet’s condition and develop the appropriate treatment plan. Visits to our internal medicine service are usually by referral from your primary care vet and by appointment.\nLearn more about veterinary specialists\n.\nSee Specialties and Services\nOur\nveterinarians.\nCaring for your pets is our passion. Meet our team of veterinarians here to help you and your pet.\nSee Veterinarians\nAbout BluePearl Pet Hospital Scottsdale.\nWe’re proud that our state-of-the-art hospital is accredited by the American Animal Hospital Association (AAHA). Our hospital is home to a team of veterinarians who use advanced diagnostics, imaging technology and training to diagnose and treat a wide variety of illnesses in pets.\nPet owners.\nAt BluePearl Pet Hospitals, providing our customers with remarkable service is a top priority. We’re committed to making your veterinary visit as smooth as possible.\nHave questions prior to your visit? We’re happy to help. Contact our hospital team at\n480.949.8001\nor\n[email protected]\n.\nCurrent location.\n480.949.8001\n480.481.0036\n22595 N Scottsdale Rd.                                    Ste. 110\nScottsdale,\nAZ                                    85255\n[email protected]\nOther hospitals.\nBluePearl Pet Hospital\nPeoria, AZ\n20165 N 67th Ave., Ste. 118\nGlendale, AZ 85308\n623.974.1520\n16.04 miles\nBluePearl Pet Hospital\nAvondale, AZ\n13034 W Rancho Santa Fe Blvd., Ste. 101\nAvondale, AZ 85392\n623.385.4555\n28.52 miles\nBluePearl Pet Hospital\nIrvine, CA\n1371 Reynolds Ave.\nIrvine, CA 92614\n949.833.9020\n340.87 miles\nGet In Touch\nBluePearl Pet Hospital\n2950 Busch Lake Blvd.\nTampa\n, FL\n33614\nContact Us\nFind a Hospital Near Me\nCareers at BluePearl\nBluePearl™ Cares\nWeb Accessibility\nYour Privacy Choices\nStay Connected\nHere for pets.\nWhen it matters most.\nStay connected with BluePearl for expert advice, helpful tips and trusted information to support you and your pet - delivered straight to your inbox.\nSign Up\ncookies notice\nprivacy policy\nlegal\nad choices\nterms & conditions\naccessibility\ncontact us\na\nbrand\n© 2026 BluePearl Holdings LLC. All rights reserved.\nCookie Settings",
